    "reviews": "\u201cI am a sucker for an indie game with a good concept. [...]  RAYZE is one such beast, roaming free on open fields of innovation [...]\u201d<br>Well Played<br><br>\u201cRAYZE brings a fresh taste to the aim training genre\u201d<br>Sportskeeda<br><br>\u201cThe soundtrack is great, the game play is easy to pick up, and the more you play, the better you get. [...] I keep wanting to play to beat my own scores.\u201d<br>Gaming Couch Potato<br>",
